  "description": "YIGJOO crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H132 Gd4 O12. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd1B (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 5 O neighbors; Gd1C (Gd) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.676-3.676 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.96-105.18°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C60H132Gd4O12.",
